{"version":1,"content":"<p>世界一級方程式賽車（F1）墨西哥站，平治車隊的安東尼利（Kimi Antonelli）昨（11月1日）以第三名完成，提早以20歲68日之齡成為F1史上最年輕的世界冠軍。</p><p>他由同為F1傳奇的四屆F1世界冠軍韋紅牛車隊韋斯塔本（Max Verstappen），以及七屆F1世界冠軍法拉利車隊的咸美頓（Lewis Hamilton）在墨西哥站的頒獎台上捧起，三人合照標誌着F1史上重要一頁。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T09:00:50.136206+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":192,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T08:24:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T05:19:00.803278+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T08:58:11.292313+00:00","content_hash":"43b9d3b8fd48113ae57b89a60ad71d9d9616a9667e53a9c415137a654ffb4831","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}